<h2 data-section-id="1dmpi52" data-start="4544" data-end="4565"><code data-start="4547" data-end="4565">LOGO_W = 25 * MM</code></h2>
<p data-start="4566" data-end="4601">Dit is de <strong data-start="4576" data-end="4600">breedte van het logo</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="4603" data-end="4607">Dus:</p>
<ul data-start="4608" data-end="4671">
<li data-section-id="pp0gz4" data-start="4608" data-end="4638">
<p data-start="4610" data-end="4638">groter logo → grotere waarde</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6q4fo0" data-start="4639" data-end="4671">
<p data-start="4641" data-end="4671">kleiner logo → kleinere waarde</p>
</li>
</ul>
