<h3 data-section-id="1qoa1qj" data-start="5372" data-end="5395">Wanneer veranderen?</h3>
<p data-start="5396" data-end="5406">Als de QR:</p>
<ul data-start="5407" data-end="5489">
<li data-section-id="1m9v7p5" data-start="5407" data-end="5423">
<p data-start="5409" data-end="5423">te dominant is</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="255sb2" data-start="5424" data-end="5456">
<p data-start="5426" data-end="5456">te klein is om vlot te scannen</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lmu9y1" data-start="5457" data-end="5489">
<p data-start="5459" data-end="5489">of niet mooi in de layout past</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5491" data-end="5557">Ook hier: niet te klein gaan, of je scanner begint te protesteren.</p>
<hr data-start="5559" data-end="5562">
