<hr data-start="8214" data-end="8217">
<h1 data-section-id="185o5hn" data-start="8219" data-end="8250">Mijn eerlijke praktische raad</h1>
<p data-start="8252" data-end="8326">Voor jouw kaartjes zijn dit meestal de eerste 5 regels waar je mee speelt:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="8328" data-end="8421"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Kopiëren" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost border-token-border-default ms-2 border font-sans" aria-label="Code uitvoeren" type="button"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-label="" class="-ms-0.5 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Uitvoeren</div></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ11">PRICE_OFFSET_X</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><br><span class="ͼ11">PRICE_OFFSET_Y</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><br><span class="ͼ11">NAME_OFFSET_X</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><br><span class="ͼ11">NAME_OFFSET_Y</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><br><span class="ͼ11">QR_OFFSET_Y</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="8423" data-end="8526">Dat zijn de regels waarmee je het snelst zichtbaar resultaat krijgt zonder de hele code open te vijzen.</p>
<hr data-start="8528" data-end="8531">
<h1 data-section-id="1dnkou" data-start="8533" data-end="8558">Handige mini-spiekbrief</h1>
<p data-start="8560" data-end="8593">Wil je iets <strong data-start="8572" data-end="8592">meer naar rechts</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="8594" data-end="8608">
<li data-section-id="1rckeoq" data-start="8594" data-end="8608">
<p data-start="8596" data-end="8608"><code data-start="8596" data-end="8599">X</code> verhogen</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8610" data-end="8642">Wil je iets <strong data-start="8622" data-end="8641">meer naar links</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="8643" data-end="8657">
<li data-section-id="1rfip74" data-start="8643" data-end="8657">
<p data-start="8645" data-end="8657"><code data-start="8645" data-end="8648">X</code> verlagen</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8659" data-end="8685">Wil je de <strong data-start="8669" data-end="8684">prijs hoger</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="8686" data-end="8718">
<li data-section-id="cb7odr" data-start="8686" data-end="8718">
<p data-start="8688" data-end="8718"><code data-start="8688" data-end="8704">PRICE_OFFSET_Y</code> kleiner maken</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8720" data-end="8743">Wil je de <strong data-start="8730" data-end="8742">QR hoger</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="8744" data-end="8781">
<li data-section-id="gopmu1" data-start="8744" data-end="8781">
<p data-start="8746" data-end="8781"><code data-start="8746" data-end="8759">QR_OFFSET_Y</code> minder negatief maken</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8783" data-end="8814">Wil je de <strong data-start="8793" data-end="8813">naam verschuiven</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="8815" data-end="8851">
<li data-section-id="tert5u" data-start="8815" data-end="8851">
<p data-start="8817" data-end="8851"><code data-start="8817" data-end="8832">NAME_OFFSET_X</code> en <code data-start="8836" data-end="8851">NAME_OFFSET_Y</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="8853" data-end="8887">Wil je het <strong data-start="8864" data-end="8886">groene lijntje weg</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="8888" data-end="8932"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Kopiëren" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost border-token-border-default ms-2 border font-sans" aria-label="Code uitvoeren" type="button"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" ar