<p data-start="1509" data-end="1592">Hier bepaal je de <strong data-start="1527" data-end="1540">font size</strong> van de verschillende tekstblokken op de achterkant.</p>
<hr data-start="1594" data-end="1597">
<h3 data-section-id="1vys9oe" data-start="1599" data-end="1626"><code data-start="1603" data-end="1626">BACK_HEADER_FONT = 13</code></h3>
<p data-start="1627" data-end="1684">Dit is de grootte van de <strong data-start="1652" data-end="1666">hoofdtitel</strong> op de achterkant.</p>
<p data-start="1686" data-end="1708">Bijvoorbeeld iets als:</p>
<ul data-start="1709" data-end="1773">
<li data-section-id="akejgh" data-start="1709" data-end="1725">
<p data-start="1711" data-end="1725">“The Whiskies”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vdjzox" data-start="1726" data-end="1746">
<p data-start="1728" data-end="1746">of “Speelkalender”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1q9hlg5" data-start="1747" data-end="1773">
<p data-start="1749" data-end="1773">of de hoofdlijn bovenaan</p>
</li>
</ul>
