<hr data-start="3562" data-end="3565">
<h2 data-section-id="1uc62xa" data-start="3567" data-end="3591"><code data-start="3570" data-end="3591">BACK_BLOCK_GAP = 20</code></h2>
<p data-start="3592" data-end="3638">Dit is de afstand tussen grotere tekstblokken.</p>
<p data-start="3640" data-end="3660">Bijvoorbeeld tussen:</p>
<ul data-start="3661" data-end="3706">
<li data-section-id="15xt91s" data-start="3661" data-end="3681">
<p data-start="3663" data-end="3681">bovenste titelblok</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gbjgpi" data-start="3682" data-end="3706">
<p data-start="3684" data-end="3706">en het blok met datums</p>
</li>
</ul>
