<p data-start="4895" data-end="4899">Dus:</p>
<ul data-start="4900" data-end="4971">
<li data-section-id="x00wzb" data-start="4900" data-end="4944">
<p data-start="4902" data-end="4944">wil je meer witruimte tussen die 2 regels?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ojukc8" data-start="4945" data-end="4971">
<p data-start="4947" data-end="4971"><strong data-start="4947" data-end="4971">deze waarde verhogen</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4973" data-end="5034">Dat is vermoedelijk een van de nuttigste regels uit dit blok.</p>
<hr data-start="5036" data-end="5039">
<h1 data-section-id="t5gdhv" data-start="5041" data-end="5075">4. Duplex fine-tuning achterkant</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="5077" data-end="5158"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Kopiëren" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost border-token-border-default ms-2 border font-sans" aria-label="Code uitvoeren" type="button"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-label="" class="-ms-0.5 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Uitvoeren</div></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼt"># Duplex fine-tuning shift voor BACK</span><br><span class="ͼ11">BACK_IMPOSE_X_SHIFT</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">2.3</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">*</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">MM</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="5160" data-end="5233">Dit is voor het <strong data-start="5176" data-end="5232">uitlijnen van de achterkant bij dubbelzijdig printen</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="5235" data-end="5372">Met andere woorden:<br>
als de voorkant goed staat, maar de achterkant net een beetje te veel links of rechts zit, dan corrigeer je dat hier.</p>
<hr data-start="5374" data-end="5377">
<h2 data-section-id="y2h5vg" data-start="5379" data-end="5414"><code data-start="5382" data-end="5414">BACK_IMPOSE_X_SHIFT = 2.3 * MM</code></h2>
<h3 data-section-id="ssr5u2" data-start="5416" data-end="5429">Betekenis</h3>
<p data-start="5430" data-end="5480">Dit verschuift de <strong data-start="5448" data-end="5479">hele achterkant horizontaal</strong>.</p>
<ul data-start="5482" data-end="5633">
<li data-section-id="1x3ty8w" data-start="5482" data-end="5528">
<p data-start="5484" data-end="5528">groter getal = meer horizontale verschuiving</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hglxkm" data-start="5529" data-end="5566">
<p data-start="5531" data-end="5566">kleiner getal = minder verschuiving</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fqugg6" data-start="5567" data-end="5633">
<p data-start="5569" data-end="5633">negatief kan de andere richting op gaan, afhankelijk van de code</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="liz8dy" data-start="5635" data-end="5663">Wanneer verander je dit?</h3>
<p data-start="5664" data-end="5677">Als je merkt:</p>
<ul data-start="5678" data-end="5813">
<li data-section-id="1e8iovx" data-start="5678" data-end="5714">
<p data-start="5680" data-end="5714">achterkant staat te ver naar links</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1a3x4i8" data-start="5715" data-end="5760">
<p data-start="5717" data-end="5760">of te ver naar rechts tegenover de voorkant</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xdygye" data-start="5761" data-end="5813">
<p data-start="5763" data-end="5813">bij duplexprint is alles net “een scheve sandwich”</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1me36jn" data-start="5815" data-end="5830">Voorbeelden</h3>
<p data-start="5832" data-end="5867">Achterkant iets verder verschuiven:</p>
