<p data-start="4133" data-end="4215">Dit gaat over de kleine snijlijntjes die helpen bij het uitsnijden van de kaarten.</p>
<hr data-start="4217" data-end="4220">
<h2 data-section-id="65aiqh" data-start="4222" data-end="4244"><code data-start="4225" data-end="4244">CROP_MARKS = True</code></h2>
<p data-start="4245" data-end="4267">Snijlijnen aan of uit.</p>
<ul data-start="4269" data-end="4308">
<li data-section-id="anotbx" data-start="4269" data-end="4285">
<p data-start="4271" data-end="4285"><code data-start="4271" data-end="4277">True</code> = tonen</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="twrj0g" data-start="4286" data-end="4308">
<p data-start="4288" data-end="4308"><code data-start="4288" data-end="4295">False</code> = niet tonen</p>
</li>
</ul>
