<h3 data-section-id="1abypnv" data-start="5072" data-end="5085">Praktisch</h3>
<ul data-start="5086" data-end="5153">
<li data-section-id="1tsxowk" data-start="5086" data-end="5112">
<p data-start="5088" data-end="5112">0.25 = netjes en subtiel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1n8dedj" data-start="5113" data-end="5136">
<p data-start="5115" data-end="5136">0.4 = beter zichtbaar</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1x74vbv" data-start="5137" data-end="5153">
<p data-start="5139" data-end="5153">te dik is lomp</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5155" data-end="5158">
<h1 data-section-id="1x24i7d" data-start="5160" data-end="5185">7. Compatibiliteitsblok</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="5187" data-end="5486"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Kopiëren" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost border-token-border-default ms-2 border font-sans" aria-label="Code uitvoeren" type="button"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-label="" class="-ms-0.5 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Uitvoeren</div></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼt"># ---------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span class="ͼt"># COMPAT (oudere scripts)</span><br><span class="ͼt"># ---------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span class="ͼ11">GRID_COLS</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">GRID_ROWS</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">PRINT_COLS</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">PRINT_ROWS</span><br><span class="ͼ11">PAGE_MARGIN</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">PAGE_MARGIN_MM</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">*</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">MM</span><br><span class="ͼ11">GAP_X</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">GAP_X_MM</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">*</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">MM</span><br><span class="ͼ11">GAP_Y</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">GAP_Y_MM</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">*</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">MM</span><br><span class="ͼ11">CELL_MARGIN</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">0</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="5488" data-end="5542">Dit is een soort vertaallaag voor oudere stukken code.</p>
<hr data-start="5544" data-end="5547">
<h2 data-section-id="pr37y0" data-start="5549" data-end="5599"><code data-start="5552" data-end="5599">GRID_COLS, GRID_ROWS = PRINT_COLS, PRINT_ROWS</code></h2>
<p data-start="5600" data-end="5651">Dit maakt oude variabelen aan met dezelfde waarden.</p>
<p data-start="5653" data-end="5657">Dus:</p>
<ul data-start="5658" data-end="5753">
<li data-section-id="hd4cvo" data-start="5658" data-end="5705">
<p data-start="5660" data-end="5705"><code data-start="5660" data-end="5671">GRID_COLS</code> krijgt de waarde van <code data-start="5693" data-end="5705">PRINT_COLS</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xc0fxw" data-start="5706" data-end="5753">
<p data-start="5708" data-end="5753"><code data-start="5708" data-end="5719">GRID_ROWS</code> krijgt de waarde van <code data-start="5741" data-end="5753">PRINT_ROWS</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5755" data-end="5801">Je hoeft hier meestal niets aan te veranderen.</p>
<hr data-start="5803" data-end="5806">
<h2 data-section-id="10t7wod" data-start="5808" data-end="5846"><code data-start="5811" data-end="5846">PAGE_MARGIN = PAGE_MARGIN_MM * MM</code></h2>
<p data-start="5847" data-end="5882">Zet de marge om van mm naar punten.</p>
<p data-start="5884" data-end="5959">Normaal niet wijzigen.<br data-start="5906" data-end="5909">
Verander gewoon <code data-start="5925" data-end="5941">PAGE_MARGIN_MM</code>, niet deze regel.</p>
<hr data-start="5961" data-end="5964">
<h2 data-section-id="77nwfh" data-start="5966" data-end="5992"><code data-start="5969" data-end="5992">GAP_X = GAP_X_MM * MM</code></h2>
<p data-start="5993" data-end="6041">Horizontale tussenruimte omgerekend naar punten.</p>
<p data-start="6043" data-end="6071">Niet rechtstreeks aanpassen.</p>
<hr data-start="6073" data-end="6076">
<h2 data-section-id="g348dp" data-start="6078" data-end="6104"><code data-start="6081" data-end="6104">GAP_Y = GAP_Y_MM * MM</code></h2>
<p data-start="6105" data-end="6151">Verticale tussenruimte omgerekend naar punten.</p>
<p data-start="6153" data-end="6181">Niet rechtstreeks aanpassen.</p>
<hr data-start="6183" data-end="6186">
<h2 data-section-id="1v4mugf" data-start="6188" data-end="6208"><code data-start="6191" data-end="6208">CELL_MARGIN = 0</code></h2>
<p data-start="6209" data-end="6244">Extra binnenmarge van het kaartvak.</p>
<p data-start="6246" data-end="6303">Vaak staat dit op nul als je al elders met padding werkt.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1pudivd" data-start="6305" data-end="6327">Wanneer aanpassen?</h3>
<p data-start="6328" data-end="6378">Bijna nooit, tenzij de code elders hiermee rekent.</p>
