:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div tabindex="-1" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><span class="block first:mt-0 relative text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary my-1.5"><div class="group start-0 top-0 me-1.5 overflow-hidden mt-1 text-start"><button class="inline-block" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex items-center justify-start gap-1"><span class="text-start">Geanalyseerd</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#43e704" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></div></span><div style="opacity: 1; height: auto; transform: none;"><div class="bg-token-main-surface-primary mt-0.5 mb-3"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="0" data-end="2319" data-is-last-node=""><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Kopiëren" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼt"># Create a concise DOCX guide for editing the Lidkaart script settings</span><span></span><br><span class="ͼv">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">docx</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">import</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">Document</span><span></span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">doc</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">Document</span><span>()</span><br><span class="ͼ11">doc</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>add_heading(</span><span class="ͼz">'Handleiding: Lidkaart Script Aanpassen (Lidkaart_2026_2027.py)'</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">level</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span>)</span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">sections</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> {</span><br><span class="ͼz">"1. Seizoen aanpassen"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"SEASON_START_YEAR = 2026"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Wijzig dit naar het nieuwe beginjaar van het seizoen. Het eindjaar wordt automatisch berekend."</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"2. Titel bovenaan kaart"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"HEADER_TEXT = f</span><span class="ͼ15">\"</span><span class="ͼz">Lidkaart {SEASON_START_YEAR} - {SEASON_END_YEAR}</span><span class="ͼ15">\"</span><span class="ͼz">"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Hiermee bepaal je de titel die bovenaan de kaart staat."</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"3. Prijs op kaart verplaatsen"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"PRICE_OFFSET_X  → groter = meer naar rechts"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"PRICE_OFFSET_Y  → kleiner = hoger op de kaart"</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"4. Naam van lid verplaatsen"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"NAME_OFFSET_X  → links / rechts verschuiven"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"NAME_OFFSET_Y  → omhoog / omlaag verschuiven"</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"5. QR-code verplaatsen"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"QR_OFFSET_X  → links / rechts"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"QR_OFFSET_Y  → omhoog / omlaag"</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"6. Grootte van elementen"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BARCODE_WIDTH / BARCODE_HEIGHT  → grootte barcode"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"LOGO_W  → grootte logo"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"QR_SIZE  → grootte QR-code"</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"7. Achterkant van kaart"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BACK_HEADER_FONT  → grootte hoofdtitel"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BACK_SUB_FONT     → grootte subtitel"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BACK_DATES_FONT   → grootte datumregels"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BACK_HEADER_TO_SUB_GAP → ruimte tussen titel en subtitel"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BACK_LINE_GAP → ruimte tussen datums"</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"8. Duplex print correctie"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"BACK_IMPOSE_X_SHIFT"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Hiermee kan je de volledige achterkant iets naar links of rechts verschuiven bij dubbelzijdig printen."</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"9. Printlayout (meestal niet aanpassen)"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"PRINT_COLS / PRINT_ROWS  → aantal kaarten per blad"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"PAGE_MARGIN_MM           → marge rond blad"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"GAP_X_MM / GAP_Y_MM      → ruimte tussen kaarten"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"DEBUG_FRAMES             → testkaders tonen (True/False)"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"CROP_MARKS               → snijlijnen aan of uit"</span><span></span><br><span>],</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Snelle spiekbrief"</span><span>: [</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Prijs naar rechts → PRICE_OFFSET_X"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Prijs hoger → PRICE_OFFSET_Y"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Naam verplaatsen → NAME_OFFSET_X / NAME_OFFSET_Y"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"QR verplaatsen → QR_OFFSET_X / QR_OFFSET_Y"</span><span>,</span><br><span class="ͼz">"Meer ruimte tussen titel en tekst → BACK_HEADER_TO_SUB_GAP"</span><span></span><br><span>]</span><br><span>}</span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼv">for</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">title</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">lines</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">in</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">sections</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>items():</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼ11">doc</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>add_heading(</span><span class="ͼ11">title</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">level</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼy">1</span><span>)</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼv">for</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">line</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">in</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">lines</span><span>:</span><br><span>        </span><span class="ͼ11">p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">doc</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>add_paragraph(</span><span class="ͼ11">line</span><span>)</span><br><span>        </span><br><span class="ͼ11">path</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼz">"/mnt/data/Handleiding_Lidkaarten_script.docx"</span><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">doc</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>save(</span><span class="ͼ11">path</span><span>)</span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">path</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div><div class="bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary overflow-x-auto p-4 text-xs corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="mb-1 text-gray-400">Resultaat</div><div class="prose flex flex-col-reverse text-white"><pre class="shrink-0 overflow-auto">'/mnt/data/Handleiding_Lidkaarten_script.docx'</pre></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6b5ca372-4319-4666-88a1-6ac02f8d3ed8" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="126">Ik heb een <strong data-start="11" data-end="43">korte praktische handleiding</strong> voor je gemaakt die je naast je computer kan leggen wanneer je lidkaarten aanpast.</p>
<p data-start="128" data-end="154">Je kan ze hier downloaden:</p>
<p data-start="156" data-end="244"><strong data-start="156" data-end="244"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">Download de Word-handleiding</button></span></strong></p>
<p data-start="246" data-end="276">In die handleiding staat o.a.:</p>
<ul data-start="278" data-end="558">
<li data-section-id="1gbbxlf" data-start="278" data-end="315">
<p data-start="280" data-end="315">waar je het <strong data-start="292" data-end="303">seizoen</strong> verandert</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3q0dhg" data-start="316" data-end="364">
<p data-start="318" data-end="364">hoe je de <strong data-start="328" data-end="358">prijs naar rechts of hoger</strong> zet</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lwypg1" data-start="365" data-end="410">
<p data-start="367" data-end="410">hoe je de <strong data-start="377" data-end="408">naam van het lid verschuift</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hrup49" data-start="411" data-end="447">
<p data-start="413" data-end="447">hoe je de <strong data-start="423" data-end="445">QR-code verplaatst</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nx3fg4" data-start="448" data-end="509">
<p data-start="450" data-end="509">hoe je <strong data-start="457" data-end="499">ruimte tussen teksten op de achterkant</strong> aanpast</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6verqa" data-start="510" data-end="558">
<p data-start="512" data-end="558">welke instellingen je <strong data-start="534" data-end="558">beter niet verandert</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="560" data-end="656">Het is eigenlijk een <strong data-start="581" data-end="610">spiekbrief voor je script</strong> zodat je niet telkens in de code moet zoeken.</p>
<p data-start="658" data-end="743">Als je wil kan ik ook nog een <strong data-start="688" data-end="732">iets uitgebreidere versie (2-3 pagina’s)</strong> maken met:</p>
<ul data-start="745" data-end="897">
<li data-section-id="1hzrm68" data-start="745" data-end="786">
<p data-start="747" data-end="786">schema van de <strong data-start="761" data-end="786">voorkant van de kaart</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="l08bbs" data-start="787" data-end="817">
<p data-start="789" data-end="817">schema van de <strong data-start="803" data-end="817">achterkant</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="w01uni" data-start="818" data-end="852">
<p data-start="820" data-end="852">uitleg van <strong data-start="831" data-end="852">duplex uitlijning</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1cswo1s" data-start="853" data-end="897">
<p data-start="855" data-end="897">tips voor <strong data-start="865" data-end="897">perfect snijden en lamineren</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="899" data-end="1016" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Dat maakt het systeem nog een stuk makkelijker om later opnieuw te gebruiken. <span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Bronvermelding van code" class="rounded-xl px-1 text-token-text-secondary bg-token-bg-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-selected"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Kopiëren" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Goede reactie" aria-pressed="