o the browser downloads them as real files instead of opening as HTML</span><span></span><br><span class="ͼv">import</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">zipfile</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">os</span><span></span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">docx_path</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼz">"/mnt/data/Handleiding_Lidkaarten_script.docx"</span><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">pdf_path</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼz">"/mnt/data/Handleiding_Lidkaarten_script.pdf"</span><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">zip_path</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼz">"/mnt/data/Handleiding_Lidkaarten_handleiding.zip"</span><span></span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼv">with</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">zipfile</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>ZipFile(</span><span class="ͼ11">zip_path</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼz">'w'</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼv">as</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">z</span><span>:</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼv">if</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">os</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>path</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>exists(</span><span class="ͼ11">docx_path</span><span>):</span><br><span>        </span><span class="ͼ11">z</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>write(</span><span class="ͼ11">docx_path</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">os</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>path</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>basename(</span><span class="ͼ11">docx_path</span><span>))</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼv">if</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ11">os</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>path</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>exists(</span><span class="ͼ11">pdf_path</span><span>):</span><br><span>        </span><span class="ͼ11">z</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>write(</span><span class="ͼ11">pdf_path</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ11">os</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>path</span><span class="ͼv">.</span><span>basename(</span><span class="ͼ11">pdf_path</span><span>))</span><br><span></span><br><span class="ͼ11">zip_path</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div><div class="bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary overflow-x-auto p-4 text-xs corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="mb-1 text-gray-400">Resultaat</div><div class="prose flex flex-col-reverse text-white"><pre class="shrink-0 overflow-auto">'/mnt/data/Handleiding_Lidkaarten_handleiding.zip'</pre></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="cde4e275-5fae-47cb-988b-ef969adf0902" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="119">Dat gebeurt soms met sommige browsers: ze openen het bestand als <strong data-start="65" data-end="81">HTML-preview</strong> in plaats van het echt te downloaden.</p>
<p data-start="121" data-end="201">Ik heb het daarom nu <strong data-start="142" data-end="170">in een ZIP-bestand gezet</strong>. Dat downloadt altijd correct.</p>
<p data-start="203" data-end="221"><strong data-start="203" data-end="221">Download hier:</strong></p>
<p data-start="223" data-end="315"><strong data-start="223" data-end="315"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">Handleiding downloaden (ZIP)</button></span></strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1hete8j" data-start="317" data-end="333">Wat zit erin</h3>
<p data-start="334" data-end="351">In de ZIP zitten:</p>
<ul data-start="353" data-end="462">
<li data-section-id="17esonv" data-start="353" data-end="409">
<p data-start="355" data-end="409"><strong data-start="355" data-end="393">Handleiding_Lidkaarten_script.docx</strong> → Word versie</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ubry11" data-start="410" data-end="462">
<p data-start="412" data-end="462"><strong data-start="412" data-end="449">Handleiding_Lidkaarten_script.pdf</strong> → PDF versie</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="14rqy2j" data-start="464" data-end="478">Hoe openen</h3>
<ol data-start="479" data-end="585">
<li data-section-id="1vddfrm" data-start="479" data-end="508">
<p data-start="482" data-end="508">Download het ZIP-bestand</p>
</li>
